<title>SINGAPORE: Bousteadco 1996/97 profit down 57 pct.</title>
<headline>Bousteadco 1996/97 profit down 57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  1.52   vs   3.52</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)     4.50   vs  10.60</p>
<p>    Turnover		   62.22   vs  62.97</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    3.43   vs   3.65</p>
<p>    Tax			   1.41   vs  (0.51)</p>
<p>    Minorities		 (0.50)  vs  (0.64)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  (0.09)  vs   0.10</p>
<p>Note - Bousteadco Singapore Ltd said its diversification into property was expected to contribute positively to the group's results in the current year.</p>
<p>- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
